# /security-review

When the user says **`/security-review`**, **security check**, or **review for vulnerabilities**:

1. Read and follow **`.cursor/skills/security-review/SKILL.md`** (readonly — no code changes unless asked).
2. Run **`npm run drift`** and **`npm run audit`**; do not skip or assume pass.
3. Review the git diff against **`.claude/contracts/SECURITY.md`**, **AUTH.md**, and **OPS.md**.
4. Emit a PASS / PASS WITH WARNINGS / BLOCKED report with file references.

Do not paste secrets from `.env.local` into the report.
